<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="3."><l>Jesus offers to all those in need,</l><l>Drink of Me, water sweet!</l><l>Christ’s death and resurrection sets us free</l><l>As we feed on Christ the Tree!</l><l>In the New Jerusalem we see,</l><l>Christ the Tree built in me,</l><l>And flowing from the throne eternally,</l><l>God’s divine economy.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
